ail.com","name":"Daniel Obara"},"message":"docs: rewrite profile README as concise bilingual layout\n\nRewrite the profile README around verified professional experience:\ndistributed backends on AWS, event-driven architecture, observability\nand repository governance, with frontend rebalanced as one area among\nequals rather than the focus.\n\nStructure follows current profile README conventions: no technology\nbadge wall, no stats widgets, no visitor counter, two functional links,\nand EN/PT-BR sections via anchors.\n\nDrop unverified claims, tool versions and challenge-site badges whose\nlive metrics do not support the positioning. Ignore PDF exports, which\ncarry personal contact data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c45e2a856f38c348bc41edb52ad0860c79870a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanielObara/DanielObara/git/trees/c45e2a856f38c348bc41edb52ad0860c79870a5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanielObara/DanielObara/git/commits/b73b8962753ad053fe2058c99ca097b0e7154684","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42970570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielObara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielObara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielObara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielObara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielObara","id":42970570,"login":"DanielObara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTcwNTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielObara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielObara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielObara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielObara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu