Now full white + a reading text-shadow (.funQuote), with a slightly\n  stronger signoff (.funSignoff) — crisp over the bright video or starfield.\n\nVerified headless at 1440: all 3 quotes crisp white, swap is a visible\ncrossfade (no hard cut, no empty flash), correct video per section. tsc +\nnext build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22dfcdf4913139e2a66105cc197d657e8297a885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/trees/22dfcdf4913139e2a66105cc197d657e8297a885"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/commits/7ca5f22172b69d1084077e94b800019d011380a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 22dfcdf4913139e2a66105cc197d657e8297a885\nparent f541e5856d2b296a46608169ba9409627fdfe4bf\nauthor Matheus Kindrazki <matheuskindrazki@gmail.com> 1782072715 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782072715 -0300\n\nfeat(skills): crossfade the black-hole video swap + fix washed-out quote (#54)\n\nTwo polish fixes on the fun-fact video sections:\n- Crossfade instead of a hard cut: swapping the clip (DJ/piano/rubber) now\n  keeps the outgoing sprite as a fading layer while the new one rises over\n  650ms, both sharing the circular mask so the hole never flashes empty.\n  (Replaces the clearMedia+prepareMedia hard swap.)\n- Pull-quote legibility: the quote was washed-out gray (text-white 90% with\n  no shadow, and the side scrim doesn''t reach the lower-center where it\n  sits). Now full white + a reading text-shadow (.funQuote), with a slightly\n  stronger signoff (.funSignoff) — crisp over the bright video or starfield.\n\nVerified headless at 1440: all 3 quotes crisp white, swap is a visible\ncrossfade (no hard cut, no empty flash), correct video per section. tsc +\nnext build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOEWLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAA