ithubusercontent.com/u/36010251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MatheusKindrazki","id":36010251,"login":"MatheusKindrazki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDEwMjUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commits/541b5e70f83d8cd5a0b580361f30e23d3c22903f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T16:02:28Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T16:02:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(projetos): drop redundant status from atlas node meta to kill label overlaps (#50)\n\nFollow-up to #49. With 15 nodes, the node meta-line ''/ {signal} · {status}''\n(e.g. ''/ vision · current'') was the root of every label collision — it\nwrapped to 4 lines (vertical corner-touch: Argus ''current'' grazing Detox\n''side'') and overflowed horizontally when forced nowrap (Jarvis↔MokLabs,\nCEIA↔Lofiever). The status is already conveyed by the node''s color/ring and\nshown in full in the dossier, so the meta is now just the signal (''/ vision'').\nTuning geometry (arc width, shell radius, label max-width) was whack-a-mole;\nshortening the meta fixes all directions at once.\n\nVerified headless by real text-ink measurement at 1440 + 1280: 0 overlap\nacross all 105 node pairs, nothing clipped. tsc + next build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60e733ff7d2dadbf0de81f0dab6aba3f5fea6a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/trees/60e733ff7d2dadbf0de81f0dab6aba3f5fea6a74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/commits/541b5e70f83d8cd5a0b580361f30e23d3c22903f","verification":{"payload":"tree 60e733ff7d2dadbf0de81f0dab6aba3f5fea6a74\nparent 314d23d128669bd1cdaf61cab44ac1a2addec6ff\nauthor Matheus Kindrazki <matheuskindrazki@gmail.com> 1782057748 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782057748 -0300\n\nfix(projetos): drop redundant status from atlas node meta to kill label overlaps (#50)\n\nFollow-up to #49. With 15 nodes, the node meta-line ''/ {signal} · {status}''\n(e.g. ''/ vision · current'') was the root of every label collision — it\nwrapped to 4 lines (vertical corner-touch: Argus ''current'' grazing Detox\n''side'') and overflowed horizontally when forced nowrap (Jarvis↔MokLabs,\nCEIA↔Lofiever). The status is already conveyed by the node''s color/ring and\nshown in full in the dossier, so the meta is now just the signal (''/ vision'').\nTuning geometry (arc width, shell radius, label max-width) was whack-a-mole;\nshortening the meta fixes all directions at once.\n\nVerified headless by real text-ink measurement at 1440 + 1280: 0 overlap\nacross all 105 node pairs, nothing clipped. tsc + next build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOAsUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMbAQAGe4dP6n0VfbGidK50rdM/7F\nSkzk0Qdw2s2fuHhMm0ORnV6e8hzRwi8hZ5j222Z+rw5X8XTh5/cWCrxXOavDM2Mv\nSvsNVLr7TDdzohwjkdOSQtxH0L6kjeM6/m2PPyYR4UEicvdHJ9LPcwAxuqlRm9Bv\n4xcc0qwlFLrQZ