e6da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commits/371c08167a00727cd61bb3387cc332cc0e13e6da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36010251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MatheusKindrazki","id":36010251,"login":"MatheusKindrazki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDEwMjUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commits/6ba13f3dc24017b04daa8a0df3e96c65cbe0298a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T11:02:25Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T11:02:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mobile): footer overlap + opaque chrome bar, scrim, legibility & polish (#47)\n\n* fix(home): footer overlapped PageNav on mobile\n\nThe home footer was position:absolute bottom:42px — fine in the fixed-height\ndesktop shell, but below the 820px shell release the page is auto-height, so\nthe absolute footer anchored to the content-sized container landed directly\non top of the in-flow PageNav (Projects·Skills·About·Contact), concatenating\nthe two illegibly. Make the footer position:static in normal flow below 820px\nso it sits at the end of the page. Verified headless at 390/768: PageNav and\nfooter no longer overlap (157px gap at 390), no horizontal overflow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(mobile): opaque chrome bar, strong scrim, legible text, polish\n\nThe prior responsive pass left a systemic regression: the fixed mobile top\nchrome bar was translucent (transparent on /skills), so scrolling content\nbled through and collided with the chrome text on every route — and faint\ncopy sat unreadable over the bright particle portrait.\n\nFoundation (gated <=820px, desktop byte-identical):\n- Mobile chrome bar → solid rgba(0,0,0,0.92) + 16px blur (no bleed-through).\n- ContentScrim → near-opaque ~0.87 black base on mobile so all text is\n  legible over the portrait / black hole.\n\nPer-route polish:\n- /now: killed the three ~200px dead vertical gaps between sections;\n  fixed the ''BYNOWNOWNOW'' credit spacing → ''by nownownow.com''.\n- /contato: SEND MESSAGE promoted to a real bordered 48px CTA (was a 21px\n  bare-text line crowded under the fixed Jarvis pill); footer gutter so the\n  reply line clears the pill. (Form was already real — inputs POST to\n  /api/contact; verified end-to-end.)\n- /sobre, /projetos: the floating Jarvis pill now hides below 820px so it\n  stops overlapping scrolling card tags / headings.\n- Home: footer breathing room; tap targets ≥44px (width-gated, not only\n  pointer:coarse, so they hold on narrow viewports too).\n\nVerified with a real headless browser at 390/360 across all 6 routes:\nchrome bar opaque, text legible, no overlaps, no /now gaps, contact CTA\nvisible. tsc + next build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7a7632aea44f7bdb8332f6a19ffdcbaf4a4c8a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/trees/d7a7632aea44f7bdb8332f6a19ffdcbaf4a4c8a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/commits/6ba13f3dc24017b04daa8a0df3e96c65cbe0298a","verification":{"payload":"tree d7a7632aea44f7bdb8332f6a19ffdcbaf4a4c8a3\nparent e6cbd0eed9701c959863b129c8adb4ded4b2d10f\nauthor Matheus Kindrazki <matheuskindrazki@gmail.com> 1781521345 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781521345 -0300\n\nfix(mobile): footer overlap + opaque chrome bar, scrim, legibility & polish (#47)\n\n* fix(home): footer overlapped PageNav on mobile\n\nThe home footer was position:absolute bottom:42px — fine in the fixed-height\ndesktop shell, but below the 820px shell release the page is auto-height, so\nthe absolute footer anchored to the content-sized container landed directly\non top of the in-flow PageNav (Projects·Skills·About·Contact), concatenating\nthe two illegibly. Make the footer position:static in normal flow below 820px\nso it sits at the end of the page. Verified headless at 390/768: PageNav and\nfooter no longer overlap (157px gap at 390), no horizontal overflow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(mobile): opaque chrome bar, strong scrim, legible text, polish\n\nThe prior responsive pass left a systemic regression: the fixed mobile top\nchrome bar was translucent (transparent on /skills), so scrolling content\nbled through and collided with the chrome text on every route — and faint\ncopy sat unreadable over the bright particle portrait.\n\nFoundation (gated <=820px, desktop byte-identical):\n- Mobile chrome bar → solid rgba(0,0,0,0.92) + 16px blur (no bleed-through).\n- ContentScrim → near-opaque ~0.87 black base on mobile so all text is\n  legible over the portrait / black hole.\n\nPer-route polish:\n- /now: killed the three ~200px dead vertical gaps between sections;\n  fixed the ''BYNOWNOWNOW'' credit spacing → ''by nownownow.com''.\n- /contato: SEND MESSAGE promoted to a real bordered 48px CTA (was a 21px\n  bare-text line crowded under the fixed Jarvis pill); footer gutter so the\n  reply line clears the pill. (Form was already real — inputs POST to\n  /api/contact; verified end-to-end.)\n- /sobre, /projetos: the floating Jarvis pill now hides below 820px so it\n  stops overlapping scrolling card tags / headings.\n- Home: footer breathing room; tap targets ≥44px (width-gated, not only\n  pointer:coarse, so they hold on narrow viewports too).\n\nVerified with a real headless browser at 390/360 across all 6 routes:\nchrome bar opaque, text legible, no overlaps, no /now gaps, contact CTA\nvisible. tsc + next build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqL9vBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaSIQALEIACwQvn9B9u4wjf4Gkrbf\nOEtfX7sO4+KYixCq3Of4O0PA9cIZFHpTLiSDMz9K10M5YP4/54r+SKJ2Je9cEvuE\nw4cNCnYroXHHhpgDxu3/7vm+L/E7452TQEfNFea6Sg6vsKDyi1YgI3DLgw3rVuUC\nAreFCkRmyJVHy//tOtjIsD5UE8LQ3bTtJFiCx0FuM/kWs6K+MkNvfY6K2T+WBtlz\nqzaTy2BPOx3/UrsQgiM20DXqNxgx89GwVcuS9UhTTMph6HWNO6+ZdnEH2FKYu5QT\nkFRLCpkKx/NVAZB9CNbHLxzKhFrqFfj3X5hN9vQ4DWCAhm++jbC3K2gzZCSkwO2B\nS4kGBEekg9Scq3QQI6V20Qb8V+P9hkoGfjeRhsrg1TqK5rbrBTcOam+2lji/BusI\ncSgwOnPxGREkpLiZVtLdDGEC/LDOcIibrJYW5aztrBpFWYQKyYFZ+LSWcpMjlFvd\nIGssCwwpTap9HSyGyHGr2w90bBYKEoaRu9hDIFO/Sp1PEd9pbwv/DihaYZc+0KN3\nFyc3nW0cKOzepKRht0SoR255HK0ZBbfOgFlc6cQUkVlVqrQ2a1Q/cozsUt2kGbU2\nwusbi2UNJUxk7jCYmKSeJ9TXYXymBrJy35N8XIErRZcAhIizjPH5zTfxDp1t/yL3\n/MMYlh7oUl3lNpqouD3m\n=X6to\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-15T11:02:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commit/6ba13f3dc24017b04daa8a0df3e96c65cbe0298a","node_id":"C_kwDOEKA_0toAKDZiYTEzZjNkYzI0MDE3YjA0ZGFhOGEwZGYzZTk2YzY1Y2JlMDI5OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commit/e6cbd0eed9701c959863b129c8adb4ded4b2d10f","sha":"e6cbd0eed9701c959863b129c8adb4ded4b2d10f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commits/e6cbd0eed9701c959863b129c8adb4ded4b2d10f"}],"sha":"6ba13f3dc24017b04daa8a0df3e96c65cbe0298a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commits/6ba13f3dc24017b04daa8a0df3e96c65cbe0298a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36010251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MatheusKindrazki","id":36010251,"login":"MatheusKindrazki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDEwMjUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commits/e6cbd0eed9701c959863b129c8adb4ded4b2d10f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T17:57:51Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T17:57:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(responsive): mobile flow under 820px — fix unreachable content + touch UX (#46)\n\nBelow 820px the shell already released snap+fixed-height, but several routes\nfought it and trapped content off-screen. Make every route respect the\nreleased shell, keeping desktop (>=1280px) identical.\n\nP0 fixes (content was unreachable / clipped on mobile):\n- /now: hero ''Currently'' rendered at top:-1030px because a container-bound\n  useScroll parallax kept offsetting it once the page scrolls on the window.\n  Gate the parallax off under 820px (new useMobileFlow hook) → hero is a\n  normal in-flow block. Data grid 1→2→4 cols aligned to the 820 breakpoint.\n- /contato: content (1107px) was clipped in a non-scrolling 844px viewport.\n  Let it flow/scroll on mobile; tighten the socials↔form gap.\n- /skills: categories were unreachable at short heights and collided with the\n  black hole; stack in one readable column, recede the visual under scrim.\n\nP1 fixes: portrait xOffset now scales by viewport (centers behind text on\nmobile instead of pushing the face off-screen); /projetos tablet description\nno longer collapses to 54px; /projetos 900-1100 band overflow gone; home\nfooter 768px horizontal overflow fixed (breakpoints realigned to 820).\n\nFoundation: compact fixed mobile chrome (wordmark + back), useMobileFlow\nhook (820px source of truth), shell padding for the bar.\n\nTouch UX: tap targets ≥44px on nav/social/form/triggers; hover-reveal\naffordances (social labels, copy button, arrows) now show on touch via\n(hover:none)/(pointer:coarse).\n\nVerified headless (real Chrome) at 390/768/1024: 0 horizontal overflow on\nall 6 routes, all previously-clipped content reachable. tsc + next build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5bedd135e1c6e19e832a7fe3f1611bac7dbad361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/trees/5bedd135e1c6e19e832a7fe3f1611bac7dbad361"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/commits/e6cbd0eed9701c959863b129c8adb4ded4b2d10f","verification":{"payload":"tree 5bedd135e1c6e19e832a7fe3f1611bac7dbad361\nparent 7ea971e9b354903e27ef86eb7a6f637e2a24328c\nauthor Matheus Kindrazki <matheuskindrazki@gmail.com> 1781459871 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781459871 -0300\n\nfeat(responsive): mobile flow under 820px — fix unreachable content + touch UX (#46)\n\nBelow 820px the shell already released snap+fixed-height, but several routes\nfought it and trapped content off-screen. Make every route respect the\nreleased shell, keeping desktop (>=1280px) identical.\n\nP0 fixes (content was unreachable / clipped on mobile):\n- /now: hero ''Currently'' rendered at top:-1030px because a container-bound\n  useScroll parallax kept offsetting it once the page scrolls on the window.\n  Gate the parallax off under 820px (new useMobileFlow hook) → hero is a\n  normal in-flow block. Data grid 1→2→4 cols aligned to the 820 breakpoint.\n- /contato: content (1107px) was clipped in a non-scrolling 844px viewport.\n  Let it flow/scroll on mobile; tighten the socials↔form gap.\n- /skills: categories were unreachable at short heights and collided with the\n  black hole; stack in one readable column, recede the visual under scrim.\n\nP1 fixes: portrait xOffset now scales by viewport (centers behind text on\nmobile instead of pushing the face off-screen); /projetos tablet description\nno longer collapses to 54px; /projetos 900-1100 band overflow gone; home\nfooter 768px horizontal overflow fixed (breakpoints realigned to 820).\n\nFoundation: compact fixed mobile chrome (wordmark + back), useMobileFlow\nhook (820px source of truth), shell padding for the bar.\n\nTouch UX: tap targets ≥44px on nav/social/form/triggers; hover-reveal\naffordances (social labels, copy button, arrows) now show on touch via\n(hover:none)/(pointer:coarse).\n\nVerified headless (real Chrome) at 390/768/1024: 0 horizontal overflow on\nall 6 routes, all previously-clipped content reachable. tsc + next build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLuufCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALrkQAJhk6MaEZp/gYvguK4DzeF1y\n5lJ7biysq0hKkMoxdBEQZLCulKgT1Z1hnVLGAh7MeJBFBX4NA3Vgrgu8H7YCiA2Q\nwWj5LpqHDfuwwzgp+EeJXmeYg7nnzgGYG2cMuSYgYsgTRCm+ckY/KPkxUYJ8QUiF\nE2n6Cozy2JBZXcmoOIUqOHkWdc/A90O+IjYZcxIV79LkPGoWjU5ZizcV9d29g+em\nr7GcRc3Sy1QUIBQgao+X3qgAnSv+DpNJoA3zuWvDvlfjoZg7naCHLZsf7a96VfXo\nR9yfHLyelgRhgDzN14yHxZyyPFXmsulech2x+JGxYozZxNGLAz9VULunW7Pxy6aq\nByvZqxUNgZYroGJu7Buo+nY5bulzxiZiK3YcEWQmECaZG+lln6L5BzmvVAxlXRzO\nZTdGvXcywIrDHt3uMMn/rJUSSHA9h4zBKlOnh1aM4CqF+a2m0LdJAkS9JUYwlFL2\nL8uhwyhfD8a78i+yrLyCjQYAiSJ6e2u/oJRz5zsZlHaKhz70AqbllsMF40TdKeRz\nXRWd3HIGOyh2+ItODgwRC8fUl+wKsOV4tzF8vlqRUbkUhYJMb/Rv6fUq/4zTVjtK\norKT0wUsE1kLmLErVwM/ptUq/NXfhWQtdPwU4tIHhW6EIS37EmH4RgEpSu4jk8/S\n9BGKsJmBQ0D+hyqWXo7f\n=vAD5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-14T17:57:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/u