46017bbf31f3c1ffcad00877bde21f8ba2fe06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T16:21:49Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T16:21:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(seo): brand icons, OG cards, metadata, JSON-LD + domain fix (#43)\n\n* feat(brand): replace React favicon with cosmic K monogram + PWA icons\n\nDrop the leftover Create-React-App React-atom favicon. Add the Next 15\napp-dir icon convention: icon.svg (cream/yellow K monogram on a dark\nrounded square, legible at 16px), icon.tsx (32px raster), apple-icon.tsx\n(180px), and icon-192/512 route handlers for Android installability.\nAdd manifest.ts (name, theme_color #000000, icons) for PWA/home-screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(seo): centralized metadata, code-gen OG cards, JSON-LD, domain fix\n\nAward-level SEO + social sharing:\n- src/lib/seo.ts buildMetadata() helper derives title/description/canonical/\n  OG/Twitter from content.ts + routeIndex (no hand-duplicated strings);\n  root + 5 route layouts now emit canonical, og:*, twitter summary_large_image,\n  robots index,follow, title template.\n- Code-generated 1200x630 OG cards (src/lib/og.tsx + opengraph-image.tsx per\n  route) via next/og — on-brand ''Observatório K-2542'' cards with real Fraunces\n  + IBM Plex Mono, route accent, palette swatches. Each route gets its own.\n- JSON-LD Person + WebSite (schema.org) in the root layout, sameAs all socials,\n  CEIA/MokLabs, derived from profile.\n- CRITICAL: fix the dead domain — kindrazki.dev (does not resolve) →\n  matheuskindrazki.dev in metadataBase, sitemap, robots. Add\n  skipTrailingSlashRedirect so OG/icon image routes serve 200 directly\n  (no 308 that breaks WhatsApp/Discord unfurlers) while page canonicals\n  stay trailing-slashed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34cfc0ba2e0ed91d9213b05499b4c067fab5effa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/trees/34cfc0ba2e0ed91d9213b05499b4c067fab5effa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/commits/f446017bbf31f3c1ffcad00877bde21f8ba2fe06","verification":{"payload":"tree 34cfc0ba2e0ed91d9213b05499b4c067fab5effa\nparent 0922f235e18956c26e408230dec2500671f83848\nauthor Matheus Kindrazki <matheuskindrazki@gmail.com> 1781454109 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781454109 -0300\n\nfeat(seo): brand icons, OG cards, metadata, JSON-LD + domain fix (#43)\n\n* feat(brand): replace React favicon with cosmic K monogram + PWA icons\n\nDrop the leftover Create-React-App React-atom favicon. Add the Next 15\napp-dir icon convention: icon.svg (cream/yellow K monogram on a dark\nrounded square, legible at 16px), icon.tsx (32px raster), apple-icon.tsx\n(180px), and icon-192/512 route handlers for Android installability.\nAdd manifest.ts (name, theme_color #000000, icons) for PWA/home-screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(seo): centralized metadata, code-gen OG cards, JSON-LD, domain fix\n\nAward-level SEO + social sharing:\n- src/lib/seo.ts buildMetadata() helper derives title/description/canonical/\n  OG/Twitter from content.ts + routeIndex (no hand-duplicated strings);\n  root + 5 route layouts now emit canonical, og:*, twitter summary_large_image,\n  robots index,follow, title template.\n- Code-generated 1200x630 OG cards (src/lib/og.tsx + opengraph-image.tsx per\n  route) via next/og — on-brand ''Observatório K-2542'' cards with real Fraunces\n  + IBM Plex Mono, route accent, palette swatches. Each route gets its own.\n- JSON-LD Person + WebSite (schema.org) in the root layout, sameAs all socials,\n  CEIA/MokLabs, derived from profile.\n- CRITICAL: fix the dead domain — kindrazki.dev (does not resolve) →\n  matheuskindrazki.dev in metadataBase, sitemap, robots. Add\n  skipTrailingSlashRedirect so OG/icon image routes serve 200 directly\n  (no 308 that breaks WhatsApp/Discord unfurlers) while page canonicals\n  stay trailing-slashed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLtUdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAa9YQAEm8/3auoxo7lKw7QQ8qbv4i\n2czNKrbBszmcbE9cAQ/wCmQn/K+oc16JfhPkD0t4Oc+ski/L7Gx66XuNAUVvESRK\nnYO7c/4U60U1yI6QXE9Uk27ljkj0LxreFfvb1DzfS5xDya0CIyRAJmOgiLLWvRRW\n8w9vvAYILcOTRFN8hMwfgPPUOgOe+ZK/BcAg66NSI58YmnJTLLbL4HkeEOcB2VSE\nxAvCxGtu6UPuoKO1/shIgpt4iq2R3hlLLv314A0Oy4xB9Ewjh071crpJMQ9GY/6y\n47adKQ+l6dOhEtnRNl0yFxhXorQQzW2qnOchif3oDTAD+ofXdc+X0UrHHyvzwrA6\nVoCbEds5sSaP7uhgO4YhYMXEu767JkLkriLVIEsV3iYiWfohxRuiJQs3kVgA4Gqs\nhap8D1I1JvXe/6iF2GR58dSsZ3xFgTuTkFiXfIFonD5KAb/U9FVQYUZ0oGzxfwPm\np/VibLM/YYXwVxcEapXOpmOySbqse3sdg2k64bIa6//BJSqdtcSkgDa5HkA/qPmP\nB+eYsZsN02EYpyVoy6bHZTRlgzWDOY+i3y/43LpKxNIc2f/MV/9FvhMczKx7j6bz\n60IBaaNk4osRHmuf0DanOH49w2Lu3iModKWNfqaPmCtXol2EzUn5lVSJtIqd/Zmp\nQ5h1s+odFbG0vRuDHzTD\n=TVBa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-14T16:21:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","s