ents\n\nCollapse the double explode→iris (~2.3s) into one continuous slew (≤1.1s):\na mono telemetry band (''SLEW 01 → 04 · ΔRA …''), accent lerp mid-flight,\nand a fast-path for adjacent routes. Add a hard timeout fallback to\nnavigateWithExplode so a background-less route (/now) can never deadlock.\nAdd per-route coordinates to routeIndex. Retire the standalone iris and\ndelete five dead components (CosmicPortal, TornImage, Navigation, Footer,\nPageTransition).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3820708668545146e21b9830ed6272b966fa5699","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/trees/3820708668545146e21b9830ed6272b966fa5699"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/commits/bf66ce74280fbf0d6f56e32ad3294aca0eed44a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36010251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MatheusKindrazki","id":36010251,"login":"MatheusKindrazki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDEwMjUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_u