ers/MatheusKindrazki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commits/5b0fb6100cebf3ff07a850def6fb1fa908b58185/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T13:46:03Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T13:48:07Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"message":"perf(pixi): GPU particle portrait + adaptive quality governor\n\nMove the portrait particle sim off the per-frame CPU loop (up to 200k\nparticles) onto a Pixi v8 Mesh/gl.POINTS vertex shader: assembly easing,\nscatter→seed mix and mouse repulsion run on the GPU; the CPU only animates\nthe uProgress scalar, with an idle early-out when settled. Add\nqualityGovernor (rolling frame-time watchdog, device-seeded tier) driving\ndensity divisor + renderer resolution; halve density under 768px / dpr>2;\nkeep the CPU ParticleContainer path (30k cap) as fallback. Fix BlackHole\nphysics to use real ticker delta (was fixed 0.016, 2x on 120Hz). Downscale\nportrait PNGs (1.93MB -> 1.05MB).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2928408c79bef35a9b1288442ce02d25d47da8c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/trees/2928408c79bef35a9b1288442ce02d25d47da8c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/commits/5b0fb6100cebf3ff07a850def6fb1fa908b58185","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36010251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/gists{/gist_id}