ki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commits/2ff723fc844461ed03cc438b8e4c6627c40b946b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T13:29:26Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T13:29:26Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"message":"feat(portrait): brightness boost so dark photos read on the void\n\nThe projetos portrait is a low-light shot — as raw particle tints it\nwas nearly black on the black background. Add a `brightness` prop to\nParticlePhoto (gamma-style shadow lift, threaded through the portrait\nconfig + particle-seed builder) and apply brightness=2.4 plus higher\ndensity (maxWidth 920, particleSize 2) on /sobre so the subject is\nclearly recognizable while keeping the cinematic particle look.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc7324fcdc0a9edb09d7546f8112f80644413f06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/trees/dc7324fcdc0a9edb09d7546f8112f80644413f06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/git/commits/2ff723fc844461ed03cc438b8e4c6627c40b946b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36010251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/