.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MatheusKindrazki","id":36010251,"login":"MatheusKindrazki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDEwMjUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatheusKindrazki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusKindrazki/MatheusKindrazki/commits/7524868797da56614cfd3283bf7ba8f6fced88fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T15:49:38Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T15:49:38Z","email":"matheuskindrazki@gmail.com","name":"Matheus Kindrazki"},"message":"Refactor portfolio to Next.js with particle physics and gravitational text effects\n\nMajor rebuild of Matheus Kindrazki''s portfolio from legacy HTML/jQuery to modern Next.js 15 with React 19. Replaces CRA with App Router, implements Three.js particle animations (home/projetos explosion effects), creates physics-based black hole animation on skills page with real-time gravitational distortion applied to text sections during scroll. Adds responsive design, improved animations (stagger, fade, skew), navigation between pages, and comprehensive component library (Identity, Mark, AnimatedLink, PageNav, etc). Includes 500+ particles in space scene, accretion disk simulation, event horizon rendering, and 1.5s post-explosion gravity ramp-up effect.\n\nCo-Auth